    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Very fine plain weave white cotton made in a great variety of qualities; originally from India, it has been extensively produced and used in Europe and North America for costume, and sometimes as an artist's support. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
